OL,3,GNEWSANew hub to support young people
OL,4,Amove on from care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new hub has opened to help young
OL,7,Fpeople leaving care with their housing,
OL,8,Femployment and health.
OL,10,FSunderland City Council has brought
OL,11,Ftogether a range of services at the
OL,12,FStanfield Centre in Hendon.
OL,14,FThe Reform-led authority said the hub
OL,15,Fwas designed to bring partner
OL,16,Forganisations together to make it
OL,17,Feasier for young people to access help
OL,18,Fand advice "as they move towards
OL,19,Findependence".
